  "description": "G.O.A.T. is the eleventh studio album by Indian-born American Punjabi singer Diljit Dosanjh, released on July 30, 2020, through Famous Studios. The album features guest appearances from singers Nimrat Khaira and Kaur B. The songs were written by Karan Aujla, Raj Ranjodh, Amrit Maan, Shree Brar among various other artists. The album was produced by various artists including Desi Crew and The Kidd.",
